OL,3,GNEWSASessions aim to 'show what real
OL,4,Amen are like'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA network set up to tackle violence
OL,7,Fagainst women and girls has started
OL,8,Foffering coaching sessions for men.
OL,10,FLaunched by former ITV Westcountry
OL,11,Fpresenter Alexis Bowater after her own
OL,12,Fexperience of stalking, the initiative
OL,13,Faims to challenge inappropriate
OL,14,Fattitudes and behaviour by empowering
OL,15,Fmen to not be silent bystanders.
OL,17,FThe sessions give men an opportunity to
OL,18,Fdiscuss real life situations, learn how
OL,19,Fto challenge behaviour and understand
OL,20,Fhow to intervene safely.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
