OL,3,GNEWSASessions aim to 'show what real
OL,4,Amen are like'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeil Smith, community engagement
OL,7,Fofficer at the Cornish Pirates, said
OL,8,Fafter completing the training: "We want
OL,9,Fto make sure we're portraying positive
OL,10,Fmale role models and showing what real
OL,11,Fmen are like in society."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
